  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Formulation of the Danish Energy Partnership Programme for China, Indonesia, Mexico, South Africa and Vietnam 2026-2030 (DEPP 2026)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to assist the MFA, MCEU and DEA team in formulating a Framework Programme Document and five country programme documents for the DEPP 2026, which meets expectations set out in the MFA&#x2019;s Aid Management Guidelines. The programme should approximately be ready for submission to the Council for Development Policy (UPR) by end of January, 2026.</narrative>
  </description>
